{"about_the_game":"Witches x Warlocks is a cute and light-hearted Halloween Raising Sim; featuring a customizable protagonist and 4 love interests of different genders!<br><br>Witches x Warlocks will be available as a free version with 3 love interests (male, female, nonbinary).<br>The DLC will contain additional illustrations and one additional romance route.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422380/extras/0e21fca870a08bd9ebd20b2ce3c8eba6.avif?t=1711982698\" width=512 height=100 /></span><br>Seven days until Halloween!<br><br>Seven days until the final exams!<br><br>Seven days until Fay Nightshade gets booted out of school for being the only witch unable to cast a single spell.<br><br>Take control of Fay and help them cram a semester's worth of studying in the last week before the exams!<br><br>How many spells can you learn? And will you manage to find Fay a date for the Halloween festivities afterwards?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422380/extras/31d460918c9cd41523f695b4a2127fed.avif?t=1711982698\" width=512 height=100 /></span><br>\u2666  Customizable protagonist (hair colour, skin colour)<br>\u2666  Custom name &amp; pronoun<br>\u2666  4 romantic interests (2 male, 1 female, 1 nonbinary)<br>\u2666  28 spells / scenes to unlock<br>\u2666  Partial VA<br>\u2666  6 endings<br>\u2666  Around 1 hour per playthrough<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422380/extras/ab7b1cc8bc5698a5b8d797bdd76cb9a9.avif?t=1711982698\" width=512 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422380/extras/d7f8e48ce8a25c92514c935517828002.avif?t=1711982698\" width=600 height=400 /></span><br><span class=\"